flowchart TD
  A[next planned video] --> X{stop requested?<br/>mediatools stop / Ctrl+C}
  X -- yes --> END[close result table, summary, exit 1]
  X -- no --> B{row in shrink database<br/>same file name?}
  B -- yes --> S[skip - database has precedence]
  B -- no --> C{video stream<br/>already HEVC?}
  C -- yes --> R1[record in DB, no re-encode<br/>row: HEVC]
  C -- no --> E[ffmpeg libx265 at nice 19<br/>into newShrinkedFiles/]
  E --> V{exit 0, video stream,<br/>duration matches?}
  V -- no --> F[original kept<br/>row: FAILED, continue]
  V -- yes --> K{--keep-copies?}
  K -- yes --> KC[keep copy, record nothing<br/>row: copy]
  K -- no --> W[journalled copy into the original inode<br/>+ record; row: shrunk]
